====================================================================================
(F2) Khat(a) depends only on the multiset of a-values (S_k symmetric)
====================================================================================
  Khat invariant under coordinate permutation: True

====================================================================================
(F1) J(E,a) != 0  <=>  7 | sum_e a_e e   (the mod-7 resonance)
====================================================================================
  consec5: rule holds on sample = True
  spread5: rule holds on sample = True
  consec6: rule holds on sample = True

====================================================================================
(B) RELATION LATTICE mod 7:  L7(E)={a:7|sum a_e e}.  |L7| and weight profile.
    consec vs spread shapes.  (QR idea: does consec have a *distinguished* L7?)
====================================================================================
  consec5   |L7|=2401    k=5  expect 7^(k-1)=2401  weights[w0:1 w1:6 w2:36 w3:336 w4:906 w5:1116]
  spreadA5  |L7|=2401    k=5  expect 7^(k-1)=2401  weights[w0:1 w1:6 w2:36 w3:336 w4:906 w5:1116]
  spreadB5  |L7|=2401    k=5  expect 7^(k-1)=2401  weights[w0:1 w1:6 w2:36 w3:336 w4:906 w5:1116]
  consec6   |L7|=16807   k=6  expect 7^(k-1)=16807  weights[w0:1 w1:6 w2:60 w3:660 w4:2730 w5:6690 w6:6660]
  spread6   |L7|=16807   k=6  expect 7^(k-1)=16807  weights[w0:1 w1:6 w2:60 w3:660 w4:2730 w5:6690 w6:6660]
  NOTE: |L7(E)| = 7^(k-1) ALWAYS (e_0=0 free coord + each residue class equidistributed).
        So lattice SIZE is not the discriminator; the WEIGHT PROFILE / which a's appear is.

====================================================================================
(C) SIGNED AGGREGATE by Fourier weight (number of nonzero a-coords).
    measS7 = sum_t contrib_t.  Does consec dominate at each/any weight level?
====================================================================================
  consec5   measS7=0.00000 (recon 0.00000)  by-weight[]
  spreadA5  measS7=0.00000 (recon 0.00000)  by-weight[]
  spreadB5  measS7=0.00000 (recon 0.00000)  by-weight[]
